{"point_id": "NP-1", "claim": "提出一种基于图摘要的大规模时序图表示学习方法GSAERU，通过图摘要技术将动态时序图压缩为固定规模的新图，解决GNN输出无法直接输入RNN的问题，并利用图自编码器与循环神经网络学习时序特征。", "claim_en": "Propose a large-scale sequential graph representation learning method GSAERU based on graph summarization, which compresses dynamic sequential graphs into fixed-size new graphs via graph summarization to solve the problem that GNN outputs cannot be directly fed into RNN, and uses graph autoencoder and recurrent neural network to learn temporal features.", "technical_features": ["将动态时序图建模为各时刻原图快照的序列", "在单时间步上利用图摘要技术压缩原图，将压缩后的新图输入图自编码器，通过重构误差训练原图节点表征", "将单时间步图表征输入循环神经网络，学习时间维度上的特征信息与依赖关系"], "technical_features_en": ["Model dynamic sequential graphs as a sequence of snapshots of the original graph at each time step", "Compress the original graph via graph summarization at a single time step, input the compressed new graph into a graph autoencoder, and train node representations using reconstruction error with the original graph", "Feed the single-time-step graph representations into a recurrent neural network to learn temporal features and dependencies"]}

